										<h2 class="entry-title"><a href="http://doloco.com/hanging-with-friends-review/" title="Hanging with Friends (review)" rel="bookmark">Hanging with Friends (review)</a></h2>
<div class="metabar"><em><span class="sword">By</span> <span class="author vcard"><span class="fn"><a href="http://doloco.com/author/admin/" title="Posts by DoLoCo">DoLoCo</a></span></span> <span class="sword">On</span> <span class="date time published" title="2011-06-16T00:47:26+0000">June 16, 2011</span>  &middot; <span class="post-comments"><a href="http://doloco.com/hanging-with-friends-review/#comments">Leave a Comment</a></span>  </em></div>										
									</div>


								</div>
																	
										<div class="post-excerpt"><p>Hanging with Friends (2011). iPhone version reviewed. ★★★★ 4/5.</p> <p>I&#8217;d never been a devotee of the …with Friends series before: Words with Friends stopped being cool long before I got my first iPhone in October 2010, and I prefer go to chess, so Chess with Friends was out.</p> <p>But hangman… There&#8217;s a game everyone can [...]</div>

